Fate Effect - Greater Serendipity - Enemy	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|COMBAT|TOHIT,INITIATIVE|-%CHOICE	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SKILL|ALL|-%CHOICE	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SAVE|ALL|-%CHOICE	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the actual allied Serendipity bonus	TEMPDESC:Enemy inside Greater Serendipity only. Enter the bonus granted to allies, NOT caster level. Disable on leaving the consecration or when it ends. This is a curse penalty, not a luck bonus. Other ability checks and immunity to curses remain table-resolved. Does not penalize AC or damage.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/fate
