Fate Effect - Perfect - STR - BullRush Already Safe	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|VAR|CMB_BullRush|2+floor(%CHOICE/4)	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the word caster level	TEMPDESC:Enable ONLY while receiving Perfect choosing Strength and already able to perform this maneuver without provoking attacks of opportunity independently of Perfect. This is the alternative benefit, not a bonus for all recipients. Remove when the word ends or that independent ability is lost. Does not grant a feat, CMD bonus or general attack bonus. Apply alongside the STR skill record. Eligibility is player-managed.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/fate
